  "steps": [
    "Loaded the Ames house sales data (1,460 homes, 79 features) and removed 2 documented outliers.",
    "Picked 13 understandable features (quality, size, age, garage, neighborhood\u2026) for the form.",
    "Predicted log(price) so that errors are relative \u2014 a $20k miss matters more on a $100k house.",
    "Compared Ridge, Random Forest, Gradient Boosting and HistGradientBoosting with 5-fold cross-validation.",
    "Picked Ridge (lowest CV RMSE) and evaluated it once on a held-out 20% test set.",
    "Exported the whole pipeline (scaling + one-hot encoding + model) to ONNX so it runs in the browser."
  ],
